<title>USA: MacroChem to start Phase II SEPA trial.</title>
<headline>MacroChem to start Phase II SEPA trial.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>MacroChem Corp said the U.S. Food and Drug Administration cleared an investigational new drug application allowing the company to start Phase I/II clincial studies of its SEPA testosterone gel.</p>
<p>The gel delivers testoterone transdermally, without the use of a patch, the company said.</p>
<p>With the gel the company will target the roughly five million men suffering from hypogonadism, or testoserone deficiency, it added. The Phase II trial is expected to begin this month, the company said.</p>
</text>
